    "id": "ctkg:v3e-object-f87c532b00768fc71d529691",
    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "环节 [(jω/ω_n)^2 + 2ζ(jω/ω_n) + 1]^{±1} 在 ω=ω_n 处具有转折频率；在转折频率处，幅值渐近线斜率改变 ±2（每十倍频程 ±40 dB），相角改变 ±180°。转折频率附近的过渡特性随阻尼比 ζ 的不同而变化。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "The term [(jω/ω_n)^2 + 2ζ(jω/ω_n) + 1]^{±1} has a break point at ω=ω_n; the magnitude changes slope by ±2 (±40 dB per decade) at the break point, and the phase changes by ±180°. The transition through the break-point region varies with the damping ratio ζ.",
